+---
+id: task-002-add-task-creation-and-update-timestamps
+type: task
+title: "Add task creation and update timestamps"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `createdAt` and `updatedAt` ISO-8601 timestamps to every task. Initialise both when a task is
+added and refresh `updatedAt` after completing, reopening, renaming, tagging, or untagging a task.
+
+Keep time injection outside the domain so the behavior remains deterministic in tests.
